    cultural_note: "The Vietnamese intellectual tradition values the articulation of a coherent life philosophy (đạo sống). At the highest level of language mastery, the learner demonstrates not just linguistic competence but an integrated worldview that draws on both Vietnamese and international intellectual resources. The capstone is not just speaking Vietnamese — it is thinking, connecting, and contributing in Vietnamese.",
    tip: "The phrase 'sự tinh luyện của câu hỏi' (the refinement of the question) — this is the most Vietnamese way to describe intellectual growth. Vietnamese intellectual culture values better questions more than final answers. The learner who has better questions than when they started is the learner who has truly advanced.",
